{'symbol': 'J', 'date': '2023-05-31 04:00:00', 'title': 'JACOBS SECURES NEW DEVELOPMENT & REGENERATION TECHNICAL SERVICES FRAMEWORK FOR HOMES ENGLAND', 'text': "MULTIDISCIPLINARY TECHNICAL CONSULTING TO HELP DELIVER NEW HOMES IN ENGLAND DALLAS , MAY 31, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- JACOBS (NYSE:\xa0J) HAS BEEN APPOINTED TO HOMES ENGLAND 'S\xa0NEW DEVELOPMENT AND REGENERATION TECHNICAL SERVICES (DARTS) FRAMEWORK TO SUPPORT THE U.K. GOVERNMENT'S HOUSING ACCELERATION IN ENGLAND – HELPING TO IMPROVE NEIGHBORHOODS AND GROW COMMUNITIES. \xa0 AS PART OF THIS FRAMEWORK, JACOBS WILL PROVIDE FULL MULTIDISCIPLINARY BUILT ENVIRONMENT, PROFESSIONAL AND TECHNICAL SERVICES TO HOMES ENGLAND AS WELL AS THE COUNTRY'S OTHER PUBLIC SECTOR BODIES THROUGH TO 2027."}